  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Tee hee{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 0a 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}, it's you!{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Hihii{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 0a 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}, see oled sina!{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Tee hee{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 0f 00}I'm in a great mood,\n{01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Hihii{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 0f 00}Mul on suurepärane tuju,\n{01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "en": "{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Oh{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 0a 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}!",
   "et": "{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Oi{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 0a 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "en": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Hee hee{01 07 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00}\nYou know what? I'm{01 00 00 05 00} on fire\ntoday, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Hihii{01 07 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00}\nTead mis? Ma olen{01 00 00 05 00} täna\nhoos, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "en": "{07 14 00}You're all chatty today,\n{04 1f 00}. Tee hee!",
   "et": "{07 14 00}Sa oled täna päris jutukas,\n{04 1f 00}. Hihii!"
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "en": "{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Good evening{01 07 00}!{01 00 00 0f 00}\nHey, {01 00 00 0a 00}when did it get this\ndark, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?",
   "et": "{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Tere õhtust{01 07 00}!{01 00 00 0f 00}\nHei, {01 00 00 0a 00}millal läks nii\npimedaks, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?"
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "en": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Tee hee{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 0a 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 05 00} How've you\nbeen lately, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}?",
   "et": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Hihii{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 0a 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 05 00} Kuidas sul\najal läheb, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}?"
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "en": "It's still only {04 08 00} o'clock!{01 01 00}\n{07 14 00}The evening has barely just\nstarted, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "Kell on alles {04 08 00}!{01 01 00}\n{07 14 00}Õhtu on vaevu\nalanud, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "en": "{07 14 00}What a fabulous evening,\n{01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}! You know I'm\nright!",
   "et": "{07 14 00}Milline vapustav õhtu,\n{01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}! Sa tead, et mul\non õigus!"
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "en": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Well{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 0f 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}...{01 00 00 0a 00} All I can say\nis.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Vaata aga{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 0f 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}...{01 00 00 0a 00} Ma saan öelda\nainult.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "en": "{07 14 00}There's just no rest for\nimportant people like you\nand me, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}.",
   "et": "{07 14 00}Sinu- ja minusugustel\ntähtsatel inimestel pole\npuhkust, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}."
